Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work (@mining-and-mineral-engineering: 0, is #chapter, #mining-and-mineral-engineering "foundations/Reading-mining-and-mineral-engineering-from-zero.lingua#r_2Z1REVC9436XNDEFSV6C9PX04S") { r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA
Understand and investigate how a mineral need becomes an extraction and processing system, a usable product, and continuing responsibilities. Begin from ordinary material questions, quantities, observations, and vocabulary. Deepen through resource evidence, plans, ground, excavation/transport, utilities, mineral processing, human work, waste, closure, and independent research.

Start with [Read mining and mineral engineering from ordinary material questions to independent investigation](foundations/Reading-mining-and-mineral-engineering-from-zero.lingua#r_2Z1REVC9436XNDEFSV6C9PX04S). The later [Complete a sustained mining and processing programme with derivations and applied work](research/A-sustained-mining-and-mineral-engineering-programme.lingua#r_1XQHJ15KB0BTJ9Z0GBXT5F2W6P) and research studies require complete books, derivations, laboratory/field methods or clearly scoped supplied-data work, independent calculations, competing interpretations/designs, and a defended integrated system. [Mining and mineral engineering sources — books, courses, methods, and evidence](Sources.lingua#r_5368N4FVSGP1G4DP5612SJD0M5) identifies authorized editions, substantial English/Portuguese reading, open licences, free copyrighted works, optional commercial references, and access limits.

**Material and resource evidence:** [Begin with a material need and the evidence connecting it with a mine](foundations/A-mine-and-material-question.lingua#r_694Z4QKSQX4N53DXACCKKG0G0M), [Preserve spatial control from exploration observations to operating geometry](evidence/Mine-survey-reference-frames-and-spatial-control.lingua#r_1ZDJAQC4S016X5KHEY4RK8GKBE), [Design sampling for the material population and decision being investigated](evidence/Sampling-design-support-and-material-heterogeneity.lingua#r_6G69EKR23DGV02YYHKMNNTZF0W), [Model spatial continuity without mistaking sampling patterns for geology](evidence/Spatial-continuity-declustering-and-geological-assumptions.lingua#r_10MVCKPNDF22PMZ7CT6MGP87N4), [Use resource and reserve categories through their complete definitions and evidence](evidence/Resources-reserves-and-technical-study-evidence.lingua#r_752AR316YAX12F1XBWQ5E6B0B8), and [Connect geological variability with process response through tested domains](evidence/Geometallurgical-domains-and-recovery-evidence.lingua#r_0N5W3EQS3YYM40Z0MZC14BQYBR).

**Methods, plans, and ground:** [Analyze cutoff decisions with explicit costs, recovery, quality, and constraints](planning/Cutoff-grades-value-and-capacity-constraints.lingua#r_2D0X3JWGVJ02492M19S11CBP25), [Compare mining systems through geometry, material behavior, and connected constraints](methods/Select-a-mining-system-from-evidence-and-constraints.lingua#r_5YMMQJH3Y0NBC8FXCD091ESR5W), [Build a layout whose accesses, production, utilities, and lifecycle fit together](planning/Layout-access-and-development-as-a-connected-design.lingua#r_0AXF4MAB48YPG888GMT46Z76HN), [Enumerate a small schedule and independently verify its feasibility and value](planning/An-exhaustively-checkable-small-mine-schedule.lingua#r_53F79J4H9V3K4WT935QA0KHDD7), [Build a ground model from material, structures, water, stress, and scale](ground/Rock-mass-models-intact-material-and-excavation-scale.lingua#r_1DMB4100MSM5KM3XE6FT4MADKF), [Evaluate slope systems through geometry, structures, material behavior, and water](ground/Pit-slopes-dumps-water-and-observational-evidence.lingua#r_16M6WNFSJ46K3B04RDAQCJ8D9V), [Interpret pillar and roof behavior through mechanisms and the calibration domain](ground/Pillars-roof-spans-and-applicability-of-design-relations.lingua#r_7VXWZ4QX9JABNDM55QRGAJP3VP), [Explain support through load transfer, ground interaction, and verified work](ground/Support-systems-load-transfer-and-installation-evidence.lingua#r_3Y7GF2FJXMPKQDN0JZ50C86SSH), and [Design observations that can test a ground model and inform a response](ground/Monitor-ground-response-and-update-the-model.lingua#r_031R2XG88PEQPGZH6A41J50TY4).

**Equipment, operation, and services:** [Connect excavation with material properties, ground, fragmentation, and downstream work](equipment/Excavation-as-material-transformation-and-system-work.lingua#r_356XP73S1SACTRRWKTF933G7AS), [Compare fleet capacity with the connected loading, route, and destination system](equipment/Truck-cycles-fleet-matching-and-delivered-capacity.lingua#r_1P7SQVMSZSPG118GWYDH7JAG2P), [Account for hoisting through energy, cycles, equipment, and supporting systems](equipment/Shaft-hoisting-lifting-work-and-cycle-capacity.lingua#r_5JABCJMXDCKAA6EHTJQWH7SZQ2), [Explain waiting and bottlenecks through events, variation, and system boundaries](operation/Queues-bottlenecks-and-stochastic-system-capacity.lingua#r_7VKF3F1X78T6E5NJNV4SQYWBZX), [Connect maintenance strategy with condition evidence, work, and production](operation/Maintenance-condition-spares-and-return-to-service.lingua#r_0T3Y0YNBQ4XF6C6J2Q8KQ70MXH), [Connect dewatering with hydrogeology, changing ground, and measured pump duty](utilities/Dewatering-groundwater-response-and-pumping-work.lingua#r_3HVPDBMJY7DFH0VBW7MJERGPB1), [Describe ventilation through mass, pressure, environment, and work](ventilation/Airflow-system-boundaries-and-environmental-purpose.lingua#r_4E51NRPHRS5164Q2AXBTEDRQP2), [Solve a small ventilation network and check flow, pressure, and power independently](ventilation/An-inspectable-fan-and-parallel-network.lingua#r_41GACPE0VDBCVS9MGQ765E9FYE), [Connect sources and transport with measured conditions and effective controls](ventilation/Contaminant-sources-transport-controls-and-measurement.lingua#r_6GA2GJ59H9XBYGTFCS9NZGXQ9N), and [Account for the people and coordinated work required by the mine system](operation/Human-work-exposure-skills-and-organizational-interfaces.lingua#r_01XGCN1DDMC661CP6V2PQM8T4P).

**Processing and product:** [Read a flowsheet as a material, water, energy, and information account](processing/Read-a-flowsheet-and-define-streams-and-boundaries.lingua#r_1DRPSJDFXNJ1P5TJEGS6HPTEXD), [Solve a dry-solids two-product balance and preserve wet/dry meaning](processing/An-inspectable-two-product-balance.lingua#r_4AH5WS3QE1Z40WJ55RQ4XBHYQ2), [Relate grinding energy and circuit performance to material and measured product](processing/Grinding-energy-models-media-and-product.lingua#r_5AYC92J7CG5938NXTGH8Z2HAHC), [Test sensor-based sorting against measured particles and the complete feed account](processing/Sensor-based-sorting-observability-and-rejection.lingua#r_1C2JP9GAXHD912MVT0WS8Q071G), [Explain flotation selectivity through interfaces, reagents, and the actual water](processing/Flotation-interfaces-reagents-and-water-chemistry.lingua#r_2A20JQZ9TPGPJ30NF01PC6QVP6), [Derive flotation recovery models and test what their parameters can explain](processing/Flotation-kinetics-residence-time-and-parameter-evidence.lingua#r_0FGGNJEAT08S8WDCECHNVJBNS0), [Design a flotation circuit through connected streams and competing objectives](processing/Roughers-cleaners-scavengers-and-recycle.lingua#r_2BZJNDFG57WRXSJX0GNMYG86DX), [Treat dewatering as coupled solids, water, structure, and energy work](processing/Thickening-filtration-drying-and-returned-water.lingua#r_2PSR8EW4FE03WDD42928AJXD53), [Connect process control with dynamics, measurements, and a defined operating purpose](processing/Process-instruments-dynamics-control-and-observed-response.lingua#r_1H6VW5FKZ9SFGTSAKW6GC302ZP), and [Reconcile production accounts without concealing uncertainty or changing the question](processing/Metallurgical-accounting-reconciliation-and-grade-control.lingua#r_1CS10W97ZP2WS11B5PZHAEGFP1).

**Lifecycle and connected work:** [Predict waste chemistry from mineral reactions, transport, and time-dependent evidence](lifecycle/Waste-rock-reactions-acidity-and-metalliferous-drainage.lingua#r_0HBC5363VH97CNXM4N9SVGCV7Y), [Understand tailings facilities as evolving ground, water, structures, and responsibilities](lifecycle/Tailings-foundations-deposition-water-and-long-term-performance.lingua#r_1VMWZQHKZME5MT61YCEG415GA4), [Make closure an evolving physical and working design throughout the mine life](lifecycle/Plan-closure-from-the-first-design-and-revise-with-evidence.lingua#r_5JNBRXVEJ85P5ZK044HDSF2KRC), [Evaluate rehabilitation through soil, water, ecology, material behavior, and observed outcomes](lifecycle/Rehabilitation-soils-vegetation-erosion-and-completion-evidence.lingua#r_1TQVJSAJR18YCGPRA48JZXJ6XQ), [Account for the work and knowledge a closed mine can continue to require](lifecycle/Post-closure-water-ground-monitoring-and-continuing-work.lingua#r_27R2N7NJMBPNJDA0JHMD51F2A9), [Connect technical decisions with affected people, rights, evidence, and continuing work](operation/Land-water-work-and-affected-communities.lingua#r_222K818VT9AFN33GJFZ08QB4P0), [Define the product and evidence transferred between mine, processor, transporter, and refiner](operation/Products-specifications-custody-and-refining-interfaces.lingua#r_4WQ464KMKXECT0MF2ASW2H6D4G), and [Trace the inputs and repair capabilities needed to sustain mining and processing](operation/Supplies-infrastructure-dependencies-and-restorable-operation.lingua#r_6668FR88NFFDAWCP560Y8370CS).

**Advanced investigation:** [Build and defend a connected material-characterization and processing investigation](research/Sustained-material-characterization-and-processing-laboratory.lingua#r_1NH1Y0TDS8D47PPDEQFYYC1P6Z), [Defend an advanced mine plan under geological and operating uncertainty](research/Advanced-resource-method-and-production-planning-study.lingua#r_5Y2NXQ412NVQNSD0MDVHBWQW4K), [Compare ground mechanisms and design predictions against independent observations](research/Advanced-ground-model-design-and-observational-study.lingua#r_7WBJ5RG8F7YE3J2DP6KK1KCFTQ), [Reconstruct and test a coupled mine-service and environmental system](research/Advanced-ventilation-water-and-environmental-system-study.lingua#r_1ZJPJ6F2Z70ZF8JQ2BZ4B1QYRT), [Defend a beneficiation flowsheet through independent characterization and test evidence](research/Advanced-beneficiation-flowsheet-and-scale-up-study.lingua#r_6BB9750AHHZD2MVN5AVHSXBSER), [Integrate long-term physical, chemical, ecological, and working consequences](research/Advanced-waste-water-tailings-and-closure-study.lingua#r_6GENN45MN7EKVN1GRKXQPYH1K0), [Build a coherent mine-to-product study across extraction, processing, operation, and closure](research/Integrated-mine-to-product-design-operation-and-recovery.lingua#r_1WXCC9JS4RM4E27NGJC8ZXYE5B), [Investigate an unresolved mining or mineral-processing question with independent evidence](research/Independent-mining-and-mineral-engineering-scholarship.lingua#r_6W8ZNWYXBYCFRMSPEVT5AVSWV8), and [Explain, calculate, investigate, and defend a complete mining and processing system](research/Completion-and-continuing-mining-studies.lingua#r_0GAPV1K4KYPK29BCE7GF7QVFQ9).

Ordinary `#mining-and-mineral-engineering` links select useful next steps, including shared Records with distinct continuations. Other source/reference links do not absorb neighboring subjects into this learning selection. Enter anywhere and follow an unfamiliar idea to its explanation. [Mineralogy and petrology — minerals, crystals, rock processes, and investigation](../../../nature/earth/mineralogy-and-petrology/Mineralogy-and-petrology.lingua#r_44F7X6GPMW6ZSCCN6D71QSVKBN), [Geology — Earth materials, processes, history, and investigation](../../../nature/earth/geology/Geology.lingua#r_3CK43VQS79NK0STWNPSCS8YM06), [General chemistry](../../chemistry/general-chemistry/General-chemistry.lingua#r_206GS6CVXD8WSY1VX7PRF7136V), [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2), [Measurement and metrology](../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5), and [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ) supply reusable foundations. [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [STEM — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../STEM.lingua#r_4B137J3ZBVM7TD2NA797H2CZ7E), [Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../../../nature/earth/Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH), [Ergon](../../../ergon/Ergon.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB), and [Philosophy](../../../philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001) connect the wider body of knowledge.

